    "is_core": {
      "value": false
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Crafted by layering bamboo with strips of sliced scales harvested from a fire-breathing dragon, this bow has a significant draw strength. This design is commonly seen in Hongal, as the shorter limbs allow for easier maneuvering on horseback. While the wielder of this composite shortbow is mounted, they apply the bow's item bonus to Nature checks to Command your mount.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou draw the bow back to its maximum draw length without nocking an arrow, and as you release the string, the _dragonfire halfbow_ casts fireball (heightened to 5th-level; 29 Reflex save), targeted at a point of your choosing within the spell's range. You and your mount are immune to the effects of this _fireball_."
    },
